  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: spring-core 5.3.18.rhlw-00010",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released spring-core 5.3.18.rhlw-00010 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2025-41249: The Spring Framework annotation detection mechanism may not correctly resolve annotations on methods within type hierarchies with a parameterized super type with unbounded generics, potentially leading to improper authorization when using @EnableMethodSecurity.\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for spring-core 5.3.18 from Maven Central.",
